      <section id="lead-dashboard" class="lead-content" hidden><p class="lead-eyebrow">ESPAÇO DE TRABALHO</p><h1>Bem-vindo ao Fokus Lead</h1><p class="lead-intro">Acompanhe o plano e os módulos incluídos na assinatura da empresa.</p><section class="lead-welcome-card" aria-labelledby="lead-welcome-heading"><span class="lead-card-index">LEAD / 01</span><h2 id="lead-welcome-heading">Olá, <span id="lead-welcome-user">—</span>.</h2><p>Este espaço está preparado para apresentar as ferramentas incluídas no Fokus Lead.</p><dl><div><dt>Empresa</dt><dd id="lead-dashboard-company">—</dd></div><div><dt>Plano</dt><dd id="lead-dashboard-subscription">—</dd></div><div><dt>Seu acesso</dt><dd id="lead-dashboard-role">—</dd></div></dl></section><section id="lead-dashboard-modules" class="lead-dashboard-modules" aria-labelledby="lead-modules-heading" hidden><p class="lead-eyebrow">SEU PLANO</p><h2 id="lead-modules-heading">Módulos incluídos</h2><div id="lead-module-list" class="lead-module-list"></div></section></section>
